  "summary": "A diplomatic conference held in Geneva in 1954, with a Korea phase from 26 April to 15 June and an Indochina phase from 8 May to 21 July. The Indochina phase began the day after Dien Bien Phu fell; its results were announced on 21 July 1954, while the Korean question was left unresolved.",
